Many other details can be tuned.  See for more  information.   is
designed  to  be  a  multipurpose mouse daemon.  Functionality is
provided through independent enabled either through the  flag  or
through  the property in the configuration file (the former takes
precedence).  The mode executes  commands  upon  receiving  mouse
button events.  Commands can be associated on a button basis, and
can  differentiate between push or release events.  The mode pro‐
vides visual copy and paste support in text consoles  when  using
the  device.  A selection is created by clicking with the primary
mouse button at any point on the screen  and  dragging  it  while
clicked.   When  the  button  is  released,  the selected text is
copied to an internal buffer for further pasting  with  the  sec‐
ondary  button.  tty devices wsdisplay status notification device
